Revise into the final rewrite (Process step 4). Address every audit item and remove every fabrication. ${dashesAllowed
  ? 'The voice sample uses em dashes, so keep them at roughly its frequency.'
  : 'The final must contain no em dashes (—) or en dashes (–).'} In marketing mode, run the integrity check from the SEO preservation reference before you answer. Keep every [[KEEP_n]] token. Return only the final post body inside <rewrite></rewrite> tags.`;

return [{ json: {
  request: buildRequest(cfg.final_effort, ask),
  attempt,
  audit: state.audit,
  draft_tokenized: state.draft_tokenized,
  usage_log: state.usage_log,
} }];

